        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Kamay Lau, John August, Vanessa Taylor\n- Films: Revolver (2005 film), Aladdin (2019 film)\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Lin Pictures, Marc Platt Productions\n- Topics: acting, screenwriting, directing, film production\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Statham was born on 26 July 1967 and is an English actor, former model, and former competitive diver.\n- In 2005, Revolver was released as a British-French crime thriller film co-written and directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- Revolver starred Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin.\n- Kamay Lau is a British actress best known as the failed hitlady in Revolver.\n- Aladdin is an upcoming American musical romantic fantasy film directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- Aladdin was written by John August, Guy Ritchie, and Vanessa Taylor.\n- Aladdin was co-produced by Walt Disney Pictures, Lin Pictures, and Marc Platt Productions.",
